Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

When switching USB functions times out in UsbHandlerHal (due to HAL
delay or host disruption), the MSG_SET_FUNCTIONS_TIMEOUT and
MSG_FUNCTION_SWITCH_TIMEOUT handlers recover by falling back to the
default USB configuration (mScreenUnlockedFunctions).

However, neither handler checked the lock screen state. If a user set
PTP (or MIDI, UVC, RNDIS) as their default USB configuration in
Developer Options, a malicious host could exploit these timeout paths to
enable the data transfer interface on a locked device without user
interaction.

This is a direct follow-up and remediation for the incomplete fix in
CVE-2024-43085.

This CL adds a check for !isScreenLocked() in both timeout handlers
before applying the default functions. If the screen is locked, we
safely fall back to FUNCTION_NONE (charging only).

Bug: 519884370
Flag: EXEMPT BUGFIX
Test: Compile check services.usb
Cherrypick-From: https://googleplex-android-review.googlesource.com/q/commit:5683ad06943e188cf04a03bffd3c3157d2c455b2
Merged-In: Id85a3170c8b42b9d38be01eb230fa7d6b8ff7983
Change-Id: Id85a3170c8b42b9d38be01eb230fa7d6b8ff7983

(cherry picked from commit cb7a9aeea2228a6d9f9582f685138e6d5e6c9d2c)
---
 .../android/server/usb/UsbDeviceManager.java  | 23 +++++++++++++++----
 1 file changed, 18 insertions(+), 5 deletions(-)

diff --git a/services/usb/java/com/android/server/usb/UsbDeviceManager.java b/services/usb/java/com/android/server/usb/UsbDeviceManager.java
index 88387b379..dad657b08 100644
--- a/services/usb/java/com/android/server/usb/UsbDeviceManager.java
+++ b/services/usb/java/com/android/server/usb/UsbDeviceManager.java
@@ -2008,6 +2008,10 @@ public class UsbDeviceManager implements ActivityTaskManagerInternal.ScreenObser
             return mScreenUnlockedFunctions;
         }
 
+        protected boolean isScreenLocked() {
+            return mScreenLocked;
+        }
+
         public int getUsbSpeed() {
             return mUsbSpeed;
         }
@@ -2621,8 +2625,13 @@ public class UsbDeviceManager implements ActivityTaskManagerInternal.ScreenObser
                     Slog.e(TAG, "Set functions timed out! no reply from usb hal"
                                 + " ,operationId:" + operationId);
                     if (msg.arg1 != 1) {
-                        // Set this since default function may be selected from Developer options
-                        setEnabledFunctions(mScreenUnlockedFunctions, false, operationId);
+                        // If the screen is locked, we must not enable default data functions
+                        // on timeout to prevent lock-screen bypass.
+                        if (!isScreenLocked()) {
+                            setEnabledFunctions(mScreenUnlockedFunctions, false, operationId);
+                        } else {
+                            setEnabledFunctions(UsbManager.FUNCTION_NONE, false, operationId);
+                        }
                     }
                     break;
                 case MSG_GET_CURRENT_USB_FUNCTIONS:
@@ -2654,9 +2663,13 @@ public class UsbDeviceManager implements ActivityTaskManagerInternal.ScreenObser
                         if (mCurrentFunctions == UsbManager.FUNCTION_ACCESSORY) {
                             notifyAccessoryModeExit(operationId);
                         } else {
-                            // Set this since default function may be selected from Developer
-                            // options
-                            setEnabledFunctions(mScreenUnlockedFunctions, false, operationId);
+                            // If the screen is locked, we must not enable default
+                            // data functions on timeout to prevent bypass.
+                            if (!isScreenLocked()) {
+                                setEnabledFunctions(mScreenUnlockedFunctions, false, operationId);
+                            } else {
+                                setEnabledFunctions(UsbManager.FUNCTION_NONE, false, operationId);
+                            }
                         }
                     }
                     break;
